# Spotlight opened from the home screen and closed, three times, the screen recording fetched after each (rec-trans.sh:
# a "wait 20" each), cputop every 0.2 s beside (its lines say the kernel's uptime, as a recording's frames do) -- the
# 30-40 fps for ~0.6 s as it opens and ~0.4 s as it closes (11-10). RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.spot.
/redwood/bin/cputop 0.2 &
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 50
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.5 0.45 0.5 0.75 250 wait 2 button home wait 1
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.5 0.45 0.5 0.75 250 wait 2 button home wait 1
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.5 0.45 0.5 0.75 250 wait 2 button home wait 1
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
